      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nAlthough an offense may be referred to by its statutory caption, the offense itself is an act or conduct proscribed by law. Therefore, determining whether a prior offense is an \"offense listed\" in the two strikes statute requires more than merely comparing captions. If the facts satisfying the elements of the defendant's prior offense under a previous statute satisfy the elements of an offense listed in the two-strikes statute, I would find that the prior offense qualifies as a strike",
