      "snippet": "\nMr. Justice Blackmun,\nwith whom The Chief Justice, Mr. Justice Rehnquist, and Mr. Justice Stevens join,\nconcurring in the result.\nThe Court now adopts a per se rule that a union's breach of its duty of fair representation can never render it liable for *53punitive damages, no matter how egregious its breach maybe. I se",
