=\"footnotes\"><div class=\"footnote\" id=\"fn*\" label=\"*\">\n<a class=\"footnote\" href=\"#fn*_ref\">\n     *\n    </a>\n<p id=\"b655-11\">\n     Together with No. 96-847,\n     <em>\n      AT&amp;T Family Federal Credit Union et al.\n     </em>\n     v.\n     <em>\n      First National Bank &amp; Trust Co. et al.,\n     </em>\n     also on certiorari to the same court.\n    </p>\n</div><div class=\"footnote\" id=\"fn\u2020\" label=\"\u2020\">\n<a class=\"footnote\" href=\"#fn\u2020_ref\">\n     \u2020\n    </a>\n<p id=\"b658-9\">\n     Briefs of\n     <em>\n      amici curiae\n     </em>\n     urging reversal were filed for the Ad Hoc Small Employers Group et al. by\n     <em>\n      Paul G. Gaston, Richard J. Dines,\n     </em>\n     and\n     <em>\n      Christiane Gigi Hyland;\n     </em>\n     for the California Credit Union League by\n     <em>\n      Thomas H. Ott, Craig\n     </em>\n     A\n     <em>\n      Horowitz, Wayne D. Clayton,\n     </em>\n     and\n     <em>\n      Joseph\n     </em>\n     A\n     <em>\n      McDonald;\n     </em>\n     for the Consumer Federation of America, Inc., et al. by\n     <em>\n      Joseph C. Zengerle;\n     </em>\n     for the National Association of Federal Credit Unions by\n     <em>\n      John F. Cooney, Ronald R. Glancz, Melissa Landau Steinman, William J. Donovan,\n     </em>\n     and\n     <em>\n      Fred M. Haden;\n     </em>\n     and for the National Association of State Credit Union Supervisors by\n     <em>\n      Stanley M. Gorinson, John Longstreth,\n     </em>\n     and\n     <em>\n      C. Stephen Trimmier.\n     </em>\n</p>\n<p id=\"b658-10\">\n<em>\n      Leonard J. Rubin\n     </em>\n     filed a brief for the Independent Bankers Association of America et al. as\n     <em>\n      amici curiae\n     </em>\n     urging affirmance.\n    </p>\n</div></div>"
