      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nMe. Justice Stewakt,\nconcurring.\nI agree with the Court that proof of breach of the Union\u2019s duty of fair representation will remove the bar of finality from the arbitral decision that Anchor did not wrongfully discharge the petitioners. See Vaca v. Sipes, 386 U. S. 171, 194; Humphrey v. Moore, 375 U. S. 335, 348-351. But this is not to say that proof of breach of the Union",
