      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nMe. Justice Rehnquist,\nwith whom The Chief Justice joins, dissenting.\nPetitioners seek $1 million damages from their employer and their union on the grounds that they were wrongfully discharged from their jobs. The District Court granted summary judgment for respondents, finding that the issues had been finally decided as to respondent Anchor Motor by the arbitration committee and that petitioners had failed \u201cto",
