      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nJustice White\ndelivered the opinion of the Court.\nThis case presents the question whether a state-court action brought by one who is a \u201csupervisor\u201d1 within the meaning of the National Labor Relations Act \u00a72(11), 29 U. S. C. \u00a7152(11), for interference by a union with his contractual relationships with his employer is pre-empted by the National Labor Relations Act (NLRA or Act).</p",
